Aggregate function :

    ●MySQL's aggregate function is used to perform calculations on multiple values and return the result in a single value like 
    the average of all values,
    
    ●We mostly use the aggregate functions with SELECT statements in the data query languages.
    ●There are various aggregate functions available in MySQL. Some of the most commonly used aggregate functions are summarised 
    in the below table:
    
    Count() Function
        MySQL count() function returns the total number of values in the expression.
    
    Sum() Function
        The MySQL sum() function returns the total summed (non-NULL) value of an expression.
    
    AVG() Function
        MySQL AVG() function calculates the average of the values specified in the column.
